description: Testing — behavior through the public surface
globs: ["**/*.test.*","**/*.spec.*","tests/**","__tests__/**","e2e/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---

# Testing

Order: business logic → boundaries (auth/validation) → money-path or
other irreversible integration. Not framework internals, getters, or
styling.

Public surface only. Name states the behavior. Mock true externals
only. Flaky = broken (fix or declare-and-delete same day).

Bug fix ships a regression test named or described
`regression: <symptom>` that fails on old code.
Coverage is a smoke detector, not a trophy.
